[{"id":117833262,"body":"问题2中对于非规格化数的计算公式为 (-1)^sign * 2^(1 - bias) * (fraction / 2^10)。对于FP16，bias为15。\n计算过程中硬编码为了pow(2, -24) 是因为FP16转FP32的过程中bias的值是明确的（即15），因此可以和后续(fraction / 2^10)中的指数值合并，直接计算2的-24次幂，减少计算次数。","user":{"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/llqx-1","id":"68b259e3cae5e3086736859d","object_id":"68b259e3cae5e3086736859d","login":"llqx-1","name":"llqx-1"},"target":{"issue":{"id":3364202,"title":"","number":63}},"created_at":"2025-10-31T15:06:05+08:00","updated_at":"2025-10-31T15:06:05+08:00"},{"id":117686285,"body":"您好，您反馈的问题1、问题3确认存在问题，当前已在整改，预计11月3日解决。","user":{"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/llqx-1","id":"68b259e3cae5e3086736859d","object_id":"68b259e3cae5e3086736859d","login":"llqx-1","name":"llqx-1"},"target":{"issue":{"id":3364202,"title":"","number":63}},"created_at":"2025-10-30T11:16:17+08:00","updated_at":"2025-10-31T15:01:43+08:00"},{"id":117668572,"body":"感谢你提交的issue！已收到该反馈，正在确认中。","user":{"avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","object_id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔"},"target":{"issue":{"id":3364202,"title":"","number":63}},"created_at":"2025-10-30T09:13:05+08:00","updated_at":"2025-10-30T09:13:05+08:00"}]